  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおむかしから　ひとを　せなかにのせていたらしい。　１まんねんまえのへきがに　ようすが　えがかれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먼 옛날부터 인간을 등에 태우고 다녔다고 한다. 1만 년 전 벽화에도 그 모습이 그려져 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "似乎自古就會讓人類坐在背上。１萬年前的壁畫上描繪著該模樣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Des fresques vieilles de 10 000 ans laissent penser que ce Pokémon transporte des êtres humains sur son dos depuis les temps anciens.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seit uralten Zeiten soll es Menschen auf seinem Rücken reiten lassen. Darstellungen davon finden sich auf 10 000 Jahre alten Wandmalereien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Según parece, ha permitido que los humanos monten en él desde tiempos remotos. Aparece en pinturas rupestres de hace diez mil años.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sembra che trasportasse esseri umani sul dorso già nell’antichità. È rappresentato in pitture rupestri risalenti a 10.000 anni fa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apparently Cyclizar has been allowing people to ride on its back since ancient times. Depictions of this have been found in 10,000-year-old murals.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大昔から　人を　背中に乗せていたらしい。　１万年前の壁画に　様子が　描かれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "似乎自古以来就会让人类坐在背上。１万年前的壁画里描绘着那样的情景。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Según parece, ha permitido que los humanos monten en él desde tiempos remotos. Aparece en pinturas rupestres de hace diez mil años.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとを　のせて　じそく１２０キロでしっそうする。　ひとの　たいおんでせなかが　あたたまり　げんきになる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람을 태우고 시속 120km로 질주한다. 사람의 체온으로 등이 따뜻해지면 기운이 난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會以時速１２０公里載著人類飛馳，並藉著人類的體溫來溫熱背部，恢復活力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut courir à 120 km/h avec un être humain sur le dos. La chaleur corporelle des personnes qu’il transporte le réchauffe et lui donne de l’énergie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann mit 120 km/h umherdüsen, während es einen Menschen trägt. Die Körperwärme der Person wärmt seinen Rücken und gibt ihm Kraft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede correr a 120 km/h con una persona a cuestas. El calor corporal del jinete calienta su lomo y le da energía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trasporta esseri umani sfrecciando a una velocità di 120 km/h. La temperatura corporea di chi trasporta gli scalda il dorso, dandogli energia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can sprint at over 70 mph while carrying a human. The rider’s body heat warms Cyclizar’s back and lifts the Pokémon’s spirit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人を　乗せて　時速１２０キロで疾走する。　人の　体温で背中が　温まり　元気になる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "以时速１２０公里载着人飞驰。它可以借由人类的体温来温暖背部，恢复活力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede correr a 120 km/h con una persona a cuestas. El calor corporal del jinete calienta su lomo y le da energía.",
